; run only for an optimized build. [Intrinsics] says what each runtime
; function the tree calls is to a fold, [Value] is what the evaluator
; computes with, [Eval] runs CGT at compile time, [Materialize] turns what it
; computed back into CGT, [Constants] finds the package constants that fold,
; and [Fold] rewrites each function from the leaves up.
